  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.226\n\nReleased on 2026-11-01.\n\nSafari keeps edited films' audio playing, and renders can pass a lone full-frame video straight through when you opt in. Apps that host Studio can show their own preview loader.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Producer:** Opt-in video layer passthrough for a lone full-canvas video ([98520366a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/98520366a6fccb0447a61f8e4baffa0f2568c359), [#6914](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6914)).\n- **Studio:** A host that draws its own loader can turn off both of Studio's preview loaders ([a7075fcb6](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/a7075fcb6c712e183736aac938d3ef57e8b12004), [#6911](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6911)).\n- **Core:** WebKit plays bare audio from a decoded buffer on the audio clock ([e181d34ed](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/e181d34edc45e2f9590007ebf7318f8a139bf747), [#6912](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6912)).\n- **Core:** The playback health reading says which clock the film followed ([bba3676a3](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/bba3676a3705e1e51a239899404f9982fca86951), [#6906](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6906)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Core:** Safari keeps playing edits' audio without seeks or rate changes ([2c1a10f3a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/2c1a10f3ad1fc2c356d3f9b4a4fd329a6900e806), [#6888](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6888)).\n- **CLI:** Snapshot gives a seek that will not settle its own --timeout, not three minutes ([52a42983d](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/52a42983db0e9b1db5d3ab0826f1686a09064462), [#6910](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6910)).\n- **Engine:** Ffprobe read intervals never carry an exponent ([f486ad6d4](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/f486ad6d49c7c6880b83cad63ab99b764ba3bb36), [#6909](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6909)).\n- **Producer:** A failed video extraction names which clip files failed ([32de0196d](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/32de0196d59f73d1f7512315eac1acb88dfd9e42), [#6905](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6905)).\n- **CLI:** Billing and Desktop handoff read their hosts from settings ([5ce6b30bd](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/5ce6b30bdbe18d5351c67b168d0e057d16d1d48c), [#6897](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6897)).\n- **Engine:** Scale static-frame verification budget with the job ([f3cdf2b47](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/f3cdf2b4739d7012f67803668f47c5e22dd39408), [#6901](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6901)).\n- **CLI:** Measure ink, one output-folder flag spelling, logo wordmark variant ([8a0b8a9c2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/8a0b8a9c2224fc0fb4e9d239556fc63e7c6411d3), [#6891](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6891)).\n- **Producer:** Render telemetry reports beyond-viewport capture as the workers used it ([bb3c3b211](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/bb3c3b211840b08ff8889e021320ba5962f0f6e6), [#6702](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6702)).\n- **CLI:** One cut detector that tells real cuts from flashes and fast moves ([525909726](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/5259097261a33c8c2aac8bcfa8c2a1b0eae5540f), [#6894](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6894)).\n- **CLI:** Cloud render uses the composition's data-fps and skips unused heavy files ([ee50cd2fc](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/ee50cd2fc0d0fe4a4eac22683ed23b6066289ab3), [#6895](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6895)).\n- **Core:** A page saved as UTF-16 bundles as its text, not NUL bytes ([88f9ae846](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/88f9ae8468f0ce9b09efbdf29720aec0f2eb3207), [#6580](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6580)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- **Engine:** One builder for the video frame filter chain ([94849bf1e](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/94849bf1e0b3bdc2d5eb118b82109e310c4215b1), [#6908](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6908)).\n- Split the cli test job into two shards so each stays well under its limit ([a2c5a8a02](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/a2c5a8a0245ef770695212c14f1f3f21d90bf78d), [#6902](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6902)).\n- **Engine:** Run the non-PNG probe test on a fake clock ([ef0007b00](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/ef0007b003384d321b90b7a9b7c0d4e06d014612), [#6907](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6907)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.225...v0.8.226\n"
}
